  m_text: "\n\nNow there were several Woodmen in the village who believed that they
    could easily win the same good fortune. \nThey hurried out into the woods, one
    here, one there, and hiding their axes in the bushes, pretended they had lost
    them. \nThen they wept and wailed and called on the Lady of the Lake to help
    them.\r\n"
